# What an agent says of a turn beyond its words (CLACKA-196): a line where
# it compacted its context, a failed command's exit code, what a turn
# spent, an image in its words, and a failed turn in plain words with the
# button that sends it again, which R in normal mode does too.
size 1100x1000
keys <C-;>:Agent claude<CR>
keys i
type compact
keys <CR>
wait-for compacted
type fail-command 2
keys <CR>
wait-for failed
type cost
keys <CR>
wait-for spent
keys <Esc>zR
sleep 300
shot facts-turns
keys i
type signed-out
keys <CR>
sleep 1200
sleep 300
shot facts-failed
keys <Esc>R
sleep 800
shot facts-resent
